#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0033 expect=noViolation domain=LB
#note "TIER B (the guidelines' tier 3) -- the `not SV._matched_` branch. The LB row has NO SV match (SV holds only visit 1 for this subject), VISIT names the visit 'UNSCHEDULED 1', and VISITNUM 99 is not in TV. Authority (rules-src/docs/CDISC/CDISC-CG0033.yaml, SDTMIG 4.4.5): only PLANNED visits must take their VISITNUM from TV, and a visit named unscheduled is not planned, so the rule is silent. In this branch SV.VISIT is the unmatched join's type default, \"\" (D72/D72a-1), so contains over it answers false and the bare contains(upper(VISIT), \"UNSCHEDUL\") alone decides. ⭐ This is the per-tier check UnplannedVisitLiteralInvariantTest cannot make: a tier swap (tier B's bare conjuncts moved into tier A) or a whole name-test unit moved out of tier B leaves tier B testing SV.VISIT only or nothing, and THIS row then reports (review round 1 of PLAN-case-fold-missing-d36, T-M2)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset LB class=FINDINGS label="Laboratory Test Results"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col LBSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col LBTESTCD type=Char label="Lab Test or Examination Short Name"
col VISITNUM type=Num  label="Visit Number"
col VISIT    type=Char label="Visit Name"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | LB | 01-701-1015 | 1 | ALB | 99 | UNSCHEDULED 1
---

dataset SV label="Subject Visits"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col VISITNUM type=Num  label="Visit Number"
col VISIT    type=Char label="Visit Name"
col SVPRESP  type=Char label="Pre-specified"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | SV | 01-701-1015 | 1 | SCREENING | Y
---

dataset TV label="Trial Visits"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col VISITNUM type=Num  label="Visit Number"
col VISIT    type=Char label="Visit Name"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TV | 1 | SCREENING
CDISCPILOT01 | TV | 2 | BASELINE
---
